{"v":4,"catch":"兇殺、神秘、解謎和貓。","desc":"扮演年輕勇敢的提奧，在敘述者的指引下，追查殺害自己主人納旦尼爾和勞爾的兇手。探索神秘的Bright Paw Industries，深入調查以揭開罪惡交易和令人捉摸不透的殺手背後的秘密和動機。\n\n體驗一場前所未有的敘事型解謎冒險，探索超過70個定製關卡，配有迷人的全語音講述和製作精良的原聲音樂。玩家可在遊戲中收集180多個隱藏物品，深入了解提奧及其家人的相關事件和世界。","publisher":"Radical Forge","release":"2022-07-28","genres":["冒險","策略","益智","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.6GB / Switch 2.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2b7abcb3f5bca80573f3684a98fcbe374467583de63df07b9ac0ca11248ef417.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7421ad47894fba8215f683afa71c8bf253aec6b0840016580dae6106080f101.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/941b6fcb6c9a0b976218e01fe256c469e124741ebdc9e048db7c868d2792e1c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd3ae578cfce1b3b2597646192ae6577451eb9219b518e91b0c173db4cbfe94a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec90f0e85abe9b7ff2a6f990842ae90b9533d347480f5a09070386d7ffe2aa81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca005d0f3b9250b9a02f7eb838577039fdc37b5e7c5f1745f2ed2061a0bee9e9.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e0e0121d6000","dlc":[]}